# fixedbugs, defect 571, lane b18-guard, 2026-10-10 (panel 205's R5).
#
# SYMPTOM: a header's `twice`, marked `deprecated`, bound beside the function
# the program calls: clang printed `-Wdeprecated-declarations` at the
# compiler's own result assertion and probe of `twice`, lines no author
# wrote, over a correct program at exit 0 (panel 205's critic, `uc`, through
# `<ucontext.h>` on this Mac).
#
# FIX: `-Wdeprecated-declarations` is quiet on the compiler's own lines, from
# the groups' close and over each group constant's accessor and the
