# (`emit/deprecation.hero`): the verdict is the one it was.

extern "fixedbugs-571-a-deprecated-function-bound-and-not-called-prints-no-clang-words.h"
    function twice(x: i64) -> i64
    function thrice(x: i64) -> i64

function main()
